		\item Si \(\mathrm{pgcd}(a,b) = 1\), montrer que \(\mathrm{pgcd}(a+b,ab) = 1\),

		\item Si \(\mathrm{pgcd}(a,b) = 1\), montrer que \(\mathrm{pgcd}(a+b,a^2+b^2) = 1\) ou \( 2 \).
