	=1+\left(\frac{x^2}{2}-\frac{x^4}{24}+\frac{x^6}{720}\right)+\left(\frac{x^2}{2}-\frac{x^4}{24}\right)^2+\left(\frac{x^2}{2}\right)^3+o(x^7)                                                            \\
