exercices.enonce:
Soit \( E = K_3[X] \), \( F = \{ P \in E \) tq \( P(0) = P(1) = P(2) = 0 \} \), \( G = \{ P \in E \) tq \( P(1) = P(2) = P(3) = 0 \} \), et \( H = \{ P \in E \) tq \( P(X) = P(-X) \} \).

