\item

\item \( A_n+A_{n+2} - 2A_{n+1} = 0 \Rightarrow A_n = \frac{n\pi}2 \).\par \( A_n - B_n = \frac{\pi}4 \Rightarrow B_n = \frac{n\pi}2 - \frac{\pi}4 \) pour \( n \ge 1 \).

