exercices.enonce:
Soit \( f : {[a,b]} \to {\Rr^+} \) continue. On pose \( \varphi(x) = \left({ \int_{t = a}^b (f(t))^x\,d t}\right)^{1/x} \).

	\begin{enumerate}
