\begin{enumerate}
\item \( \begin{pmatrix} (x+2y)(y+2z) \\ -(2x+y)(y+2z) \\ (2x+y)(2y+z)
\end{pmatrix} \) sauf pour \( M = \pm\frac2{\sqrt3}(1,-2,1) \).

\item \( (x-z)(x+y+z) = 0 \).

\item segment \( x = z\in {[-1,1]} \) et ellipse \( x^2+z^2+xz = 1 \).
